{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"id":"mal-37396","ids":{"mal":37396,"shikimori":37396,"anilist":101231,"anilibria":8449,"kodik":"movie-110676"},"title":"Вкусы молодости","originalTitle":"Shikioriori","alt":"Вкусы молодости Shikioriori Вкусы молодости, Ароматы молодсти Shikioriori","year":2018,"type":"MOVIE","genres":["Драма","Романтика"],"description":"Фильм-антология, состоящий из трёх коротких историй, каждая из которых происходит в одном из китайских городов, и с основной темой для каждой: 1. «Солнечный завтрак» (город — Пекин, тема — еда); 2. «Маленький показ мод» (город — Гуанчжоу, тема — одежда). 3. «Любовь в Шанхае» (город — Шанхай, тема — кров).","ongoing":false,"releasedEpisodes":[1],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/37396/0077ca2e3b3189a014459853defea2c0.jpeg","width":700,"height":990},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101231-QB3E5LNZUPYg.jpg","width":1200,"height":675}},"episodes":[{"number":1,"audio":[{"id":"anilibria","dubId":"AniLibria","label":"AniLibria (RU)","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":4448,"sources":[{"quality":1080,"url":"https://cache-rfn.libria.fun/videos/media/ts/8449/1/1080/a6da0223dd125d662393806b235cc818.m3u8?countryIso=KZ&isAuthorized=0&isWithVideoAds=1&isWithVideoAdsAlways=1","stream":true},{"quality":720,"url":"https://cache-rfn.libria.fun/videos/media/ts/8449/1/720/58afe3b52fb893eceae9e4cf37661bca.m3u8?countryIso=KZ&isAuthorized=0&isWithVideoAds=1&isWithVideoAdsAlways=1","stream":true},{"quality":480,"url":"https://cache-rfn.libria.fun/videos/media/ts/8449/1/480/56ccc2c738d0a20fdf4997cfef1978d8.m3u8?countryIso=KZ&isAuthorized=0&isWithVideoAds=1&isWithVideoAdsAlways=1","stream":true}],"subtitles":[],"opening":{"absent":true},"ending":{"absent":true}},{"id":"kodik-3556","dubId":"3556","label":"BeeSound","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"movie-110676","translationId":"3556","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/video/110676/43575be6ef917c154f4987023943bbc0/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-1500","dubId":"1500","label":"YakuSub Studio.Subtitles","language":"ja","original":true,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"movie-90743","translationId":"1500","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/video/90743/c7d5f768fc3998f5ba57fbbe20a924c4/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-559","dubId":"559","label":"KANSAI Studio","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"movie-35007","translationId":"559","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/video/35007/65a64024165a0eff419c2ddab24f4458/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}],"season":1,"ordinal":1}],"translations":{"en":["Flavors of Youth","Anthology film for three short stories. \n \nThe three shorts in the anthology are titled \"Hidamari no Choushoku\" (Sunny Breakfast), \"Chiisana Fashion Show\" (A Small Fashion Show), and \"Shanghai Koi\" (Shanghai Love), and all three will be set in three different Chinese cities. \n\n\n\nThe theme of the three stories are food, clothing, and shelter. \"Hidamari no Choushoku\" is about a youth working in Beijing and a grandmother in his hometown. \"Chiisana Fashion Show\" is about sisters living in Guangzhou. \"Shanghai Koi\" is set in 1990s Shanghai and is a homage to Byousoku 5 Centimeter (5 Centimeters Per Second)."],"ja":["詩季織々",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"movie-110676":"2025-05-02T14:28:09Z","movie-90743":"2022-11-15T09:21:13Z","movie-35007":"2020-03-12T19:50:27Z"},"kodikIds":["movie-110676","movie-90743","movie-35007"],"relatedMalIds":[],"rating":7.12}]}